          "topic": "Dot product and angle",
          "content_type": "explanation",
          "text": "For vectors a and b, a·b = |a||b|cosθ. In components, (a₁,a₂,a₃)·(b₁,b₂,b₃)=a₁b₁+a₂b₂+a₃b₃. A zero dot product indicates perpendicular nonzero vectors.",
